<song>
  <title>5. Rock of My Salvation</title>
  <lyrics>[V1]
 Praise the Rock of my salvation.
 Praise the mighty God above.
 Come before His sacred presence,
 With an off'ring of love.

[C1]
 Hallelujah, Hallelujah,
 He is God, and He alone,
 Hallelujah, Hallelujah,
 Come with joy before His throne.

[V2]
 Praise the Rock of my salvation.
 Jesus' blood atones for sin.
 Jesus at the door of mercy,
 Waits to let us in.

[C2]
 Hallelujah, (Hallelujah,) Hallelujah,
 He is God, and He alone,
 Hallelujah, (Hallelujah,) Hallelujah,
 Come with joy before His throne.

[V3]
 Praise, my soul, the King of heaven,
 To His feet thy tribute bring.
 Ransomed, healed, restored, forgiven,
 Who His praise shall sing?

[V4]
 Praise the Rock of my salvation.
 Praise the Father's boundless love.
 Praise the Lamb, my great redemption.
 Praise the Father above.

[C3]
 Hallelujah, Hallelujah,
 He is God, and He alone,
 Hallelujah, Hallelujah,
 [: Come with joy before His throne :]
 Hallelujah!</lyrics>
